{"id":"3976a06c4bfa0dd4","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-measure7-hellinger-distance.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Hellinger Distance","display":"df-zfc-measure7-hellinger-distance — ZFC Measure7 Hellinger Distance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-hellinger-distance","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-hellinger-distance"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-hellinger-distance — ZFC Measure7 Hellinger Distance","depends_on":["[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-radon-nikodym]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-hellinger-distance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-hellinger-distance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-hellinger-distance — ZFC Measure7 Hellinger Distance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"31e71a3e39e9a1b8\" href=\"?note=31e71a3e39e9a1b8\" title=\"58-df-radon-nikodym\">58-df-radon-nikodym</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> (measure-space carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (measurable sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu\">\\(\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu\\)</span> (measures on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal A)\">\\((X,\\mathcal A)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in[0,\\infty]^X\">\\(f,g\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\)</span> (Radon--Nikodym density witnesses).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in[0,\\infty)\">\\(r\\in[0,\\infty)\\)</span> (Hellinger distance value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\nu,\\mu;X,\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\nu,\\mu;X,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> (measure-space and exact Radon--Nikodym signatures).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7HellingerDistance}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7HellingerDistance}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}hellinger\\text{-}distance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7HellingerDistance}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu,r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\nu)\\land\\mu(X)=\\nu(X)=1\\land r\\in[0,1]\\land\\exists f,g\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\mu,\\lambda;X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(g,\\nu,\\lambda;X,\\mathcal A)\\land r=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\left(\\int_X(\\sqrt f-\\sqrt g)^2\\,d\\lambda\\right)^{1/2}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}hellinger\\text{-}distance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7HellingerDistance}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu,r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\nu)\\land\\mu(X)=\\nu(X)=1\\land r\\in[0,1]\\land\\exists f,g\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\mu,\\lambda;X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(g,\\nu,\\lambda;X,\\mathcal A)\\land r=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\left(\\int_X(\\sqrt f-\\sqrt g)^2\\,d\\lambda\\right)^{1/2}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The density witnesses are bound by the canonical Radon--Nikodym relation. The factor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/\\sqrt2\">\\(1/\\sqrt2\\)</span> fixes the convention with range <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span> for probability measures.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-radon-nikodym","status":"resolved","id":"31e71a3e39e9a1b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-radon-nikodym]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in[0,\\infty]^X","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in[0,\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\nu,\\mu;X,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7HellingerDistance}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}hellinger\\text{-}distance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7HellingerDistance}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu,r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\nu)\\land\\mu(X)=\\nu(X)=1\\land r\\in[0,1]\\land\\exists f,g\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(f,\\mu,\\lambda;X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(g,\\nu,\\lambda;X,\\mathcal A)\\land r=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\left(\\int_X(\\sqrt f-\\sqrt g)^2\\,d\\lambda\\right)^{1/2}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"1/\\sqrt2","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false}],"bytes":1616,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2632","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-measure7-hellinger-distance.md|58-df-zfc-measure7-hellinger-distance]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["83a15c7e9b3817dc","31e71a3e39e9a1b8"]}